WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:12.270
In this lesson, you will learn to add 1 to a score each time a gem is collected, and check the score at the end.

2
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:17.148
The score counts how well you are doing.

3
00:00:17.148 --> 00:00:19.687
It starts at 0.

4
00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:25.870
Each time you collect a gem, add 1 to the score.

5
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:29.878
Collect 3 gems → score 3.

6
00:00:29.878 --> 00:00:32.852
The score matches the gems!

7
00:00:33.452 --> 00:00:38.600
Games say “You win!” when the score is big enough.

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:46.522
Collect 3 gems. After each one, add 1 to ⭐ score. End with score 3.

9
00:00:46.522 --> 00:00:50.365
Score 3! One point for every gem.

10
00:00:50.965 --> 00:00:54.809
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:54.809 --> 00:00:59.957
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
